sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Service as Service
    participant ObjectNotFoundException as ObjectNotFoundException
    participant CallStack as Call Stack
    participant GlobalExceptionHandler as Global Exception Handler

    Service->>Service: Detect object not found condition
    Note right of Service: Service method detects object not found condition

    Service->>ObjectNotFoundException: new ObjectNotFoundException(message)
    Note right of ObjectNotFoundException: ObjectNotFoundException instantiated with error message

    Service->>ObjectNotFoundException: throw exception
    Note right of ObjectNotFoundException: Exception thrown to caller

    ObjectNotFoundException->>CallStack: Exception propagates through call stack
    Note right of CallStack: Exception propagates through call stack

    CallStack->>GlobalExceptionHandler: Uncaught exception reaches handler
    Note right of GlobalExceptionHandler: Global exception handler catches exception

    GlobalExceptionHandler->>GlobalExceptionHandler: Generate error response
    Note right of GlobalExceptionHandler: Error response generated and formatted

    GlobalExceptionHandler->>Client: HTTP 404 response with error details
    Note right of Client: ResponseEntity[StandardError] returned to client